My diagnosis is terminal & there’s no cure.

I have “Founder Brain” 🤣

Disclaimer: You CAN be an employee and have founder brain 🎯

Every job I’ve ever had needed some kind of ownership attached to it or I couldn’t function. Amazon delivery driver = my route, my truck, my problem. AE = my pipeline, my deals. Chief of staff = running sh*t. 

Even on the pitch I play centerback. The position where you organize like crazy & if you mess up, it’s a goal 💀

I don’t know how to operate without skin in the game. Pressure is where I actually wake up.

Meanwhile employee brain is out here cringing because someone is saying “slay” in the “corporate conversation.” 

Bro… that’s a serious symptom. Get checked.

